  "ruleText": "Pas 309.04 General Inspection Forms.\n\nThe prior filings affecting the repealed Pas 303.02 included the following documents:\n\n#2297, eff 2-7-83\n\n#2704, eff 5-9-84, EXPIRED 5-9-90 (formerly Saf-S 1003.02)\n\n#4862, eff 7-10-90\n\n#6020, eff 4-14-95\n\n#6284, eff 7-10-96\n\n#7800, eff 12-11-02, EXPIRED 12-11-10\n\n#10072, eff 1-11-12\n\n#12989, eff 2-5-20\n\nThe prior filings affecting the repealed Pas 303.03 included the following documents:\n\n#2297, eff 2-7-83\n\n#2704, eff 5-9-84, EXPIRED 5-9-90 (formerly Saf-S 1003.03)\n\n#4862, eff 7-10-90\n\n#6020, eff 4-14-95\n\n#6284, eff 7-10-96\n\n#7800, eff 12-11-02, EXPIRED 12-11-10\n\n#10072, eff 1-11-12\n\nThe prior filings affecting the repealed Pas 309.01 included the following documents:\n\n#6020, eff 4-14-95\n\n#6284, eff 7-10-96\n\n#7800, eff 12-11-02\n\n#9354-B, eff 1-3-09; EXPIRED: 12-11-10, except for para (a)(9)\n\n#10072, eff 1-11-12\n\n#10382, eff 7-23-13\n\n#12989, eff 2-5-20\n\nThe prior filings affecting the repealed Pas 309.02 included the following documents:\n\n#6020, eff 4-14-95\n\n#6284, eff 7-10-96\n\n#7800, eff 12-11-02, expired 12-11-10\n\n#10072, eff 1-11-12\n\n#10382, eff 7-23-13\n\n#12989, eff 2-5-20\n\nThe prior filings affecting the repealed Pas 309.03 included the following documents:\n\n#6020, eff 4-14-95\n\n#6284, eff 7-10-96\n\n#7800, eff 12-11-02, EXPIRED 12-11-10\n\n#10072, eff 1-11-12\n\nThe prior filings affecting the repealed Pas 309.04 included the following documents:\n\n#6020, eff 4-14-95\n\n#6284, eff 7-10-96\n\n#7800, eff 12-11-02\n\n#9354-B, eff 1-3-09; EXPIRED: 12-11-10, except for para (b)(7)d.\n\n#10072, eff 1-11-12\n\n#10382, eff 7-23-13\n\n#12989, eff 2-5-20",
